---
title: A letter with a page-width letterhead
flm:
  use: [letter]
  features:
    compose:
      template_config:
        html:
          letter:
            logo: placeholder
            logo_alt: Example organization
            letterhead: page-width
            logo_max_height: 45mm
            letterhead_margin_top: 0mm
        latex-rendered:
          letter:
            logo: placeholder
            letterhead: page-width
            logo_max_height: 45mm
            letterhead_margin_top: 0mm
---
\begin{letter}

\begin{fromaddress}
Example Organization\\
100 Example Street\\
10115 Berlin, Germany
\end{fromaddress}

\letterdate{16 November 2026}
\salutation{Dear colleague,}

The letterhead spans the page, while the sender, date, and letter body use the
text margins. The graphic keeps its proportions within the configured maximum
height.

\closing{Kind regards,}
\begin{signature}
Alex Morgan
\end{signature}

\end{letter}
